ABEA54E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1560305028:1":{"text":"사흘 밤... 음, 그럼 아르사와 소렌은 시더 마을의 축제에는 못 오겠네요.","source_cn":"三个晚上……唔，看来阿尔萨和索恩没时间参与雪松镇的庆典了呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A18D4F2C9F966E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1560305029:0":{"text":"축제? 축제를 열 거야?","source_cn":"庆典？是你们举办的庆典吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CE9EF3C9A19F6A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:44:1560305030:0":{"text":"아르사에게 한겨울 축제에 대해 설명해 주었다...","source_cn":"你们向阿尔萨说明了隆冬节庆典的事……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFAA22364BD12721A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아르사에게 한겨울 축제에 대해 설명해 주었다...","female":"아르사에게 한겨울 축제에 대해 설명해 주었다...","variant_male_record_index":"196052","variant_female_record_index":"196053","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1560305031:0":{"text":"아... 아쉽게 시간이 겹치네. 내가 직접 갈 수는 없지만, 우리가 구운 바베큐를 보낼 수는 있지!","source_cn":"啊……真不巧，时间撞上了。不过，虽然我不能参加，但我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87FAC85FAECD1359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1560305032:0":{"text":"바베큐?","source_cn":"烤肉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79A4